ill update the project details in your workspace dashboard.','2026-06-19 13:03:37'),(383,51,'user','How to add task?','2026-06-19 13:03:55'),(384,51,'bot','To add a task, follow these steps:\n1. Open the specific project\'s detailed view panel page.\n2. Navigate to the \"Task Board\" or \"Tasks\" sub-section and click the \"Add New Task\" trigger button.\n3. Enter the Task Name and other relevant details, such as:\n   - Assign a Priority Level\n   - Set deadlines if applicable\n4. Hit \"Save\" to add the task to the project\'s task list.\n\nThis will create a new task and add it to the project\'s task board for tracking and management.','2026-06-19 13:03:55'),(385,51,'user','How to add budget?','2026-06-19 13:04:40'),(386,51,'bot','To add or manage a budget, follow these steps:\n1. Open the specific Project Workspace panel or navigate directly to the Budget Tracking Dashboard view.\n2. To log costs or set budget targets, locate the \"Expense / Budget Matrix Form\".\n3. Insert the baseline amount and select the corresponding allocation category.\n4. Update to instantly review dynamic budget consumption status charts.\n\nThis will allow you to track and manage the budget for your project.','2026-06-19 13:04:40'),(387,51,'user','how to update profile','2026-06-19 13:09:00'),(388,51,'bot','To update your profile, follow these steps:\n\n1. Click on the User Profile Area / User Avatar badge located at the top-right header corner (right next to the \"Welcome Bunny\" greeting).\n2. Select \"Profile Settings\" from the dropdown to update your profile details like Name, Email, or trigger a Secure Password Change.\n\n**Note:** The exact steps may vary slightly depending on the specific layout and design of your workspace, but the general process should be the same. If you have any issues or need further assistance, feel free to ask.','2026-06-19 13:09:00'),(389,52,'user','Future risk projects','2026-06-19 13:46:35'),(390,52,'bot','? *Risky Projects*\n\n• Modern Villa (Deadline